SUMMARY:[Hike - Intermediate] Walker Woods
DESCRIPTION:GTA Hiking & Stuff\n**NOTE:** $6.00 paid parking in effect (pa
 yable online **ONLY**).\n\nPlease bring your cell phone to scan the barcod
 e in the parking lot.\nYou will want to arrive a few mins early to get thi
 s done.\n\nPayment is made through the Hotspot App. You should download th
 e app before arriving.\n\nSee link ([Permit Parking and Trail Sustainabili
 ty](https://www.uxbridge.ca/en/transportation/permit-parking-and-trail-sus
 tainability.aspx#Download-the-HotSpot-App-or-access-the-HotSpot-website-to
 -begin)).\n\n**NOTE:** This is the Towers Parking.\n\nWalker Woods is anot
 her beautiful hiking area up near the Uxbridge area. This is an intermedia
 te hike. There are some sections with hills that will get your heart rate 
 up.\n\nBring a water bottle and dress for the weather. Chances are there w
 ill be mud and even some snow.\n\nWalker Woods Trailhead Parking Lot off C
 oncession Road 7 near Uxbridge ([https://goo.gl/maps/beVD2rNnwy4CWKxr8](ht
 tps://goo.gl/maps/beVD2rNnwy4CWKxr8)). There is a parking lot just off the
  road.\n\nWe leave for the hike at 9:05am SHARP.\n\n**Winter Hiking Season
  Information:**\nPlease note that as we get into winter hiking with snow a
 nd slippery trails\, we consider proper Crampons to be mandatory.\nThe eve
 nt host can ask you not to participate if you don't have proper footwear i
 ncluding Crampons. More [Crampon Information](https://www.meetup.com/gta-h
 iking-meetup/events/297067178/).\n\n**LEGAL DISCLAIMER AND LIABILITY INFOR
 MATION:**\n\nBy RSVP'ing and paying the event fee (if applicable)\, you ar
 e confirming that you have read\, understand and accept the following:\n\n
 1. **GTA Hiking Meetup is a private group**. Attending events is voluntary
  by you as a member. Participation in any activity with us is at your own 
 risk.\n2. By joining this event as a member you agree to indemnify and hol
 d harmless its organizers\, co-organizers\, assistant organizers\, event h
 osts\, and other members from all claims or liability of every type (inclu
 ding court costs and legal fees) for injury or death to any person or for 
 damage to property\, loss of personal property or any other wrongful act a
 rising out of or relating to your participation as a member. This agreemen
 t applies to you and to other persons (as your guests) who may accompany y
 ou in these endeavors.\n3. You also agree to hold the organizers as well a
 s other group members harmless. By participating voluntarily in the group\
