SUMMARY:Wilder Forest/Pleasure Valley\, Intermediate Hike
DESCRIPTION:GTA Hiking & Stuff\nJoin us in an autumn hike at Pleasure Vall
 ey/Walker Woods! This will be a longer than normal hike for the GTA Hiking
  group. We have scheduled the hike for 3 hours but it may take longer to c
 omplete depending on how many times we stop. Bring snacks and water to kee
 p the engine running.\n\nThe Glen Major Forest is one of the most mature f
 orests within the Durham Regional Forest network. The route follows the wi
 de trails with a very good variety of scenic viewpoints. We will do a larg
 e loop enjoying the many rolling hills.\n\nThe pace will be moderate\, tak
 ing breaks along the way. We can adjust as needed. The length of the hike 
 is roughly 10-11 km in 3hrs or more.\n\nCome out and enjoy the crisp fall 
 air and take in some forest bathing.\n\n**Note**\n\n- Arrive on time! Canc
 el if you can't make it.\n- Know your limits! Hike within your fitness lev
 el.\n- Dress for the conditions.\n- Proper footwear is required.\n- Be awa
 re and prepared for ticks.\n- Free Parking.\n- No Dogs.\n- The hike will b
 e canceled if the weather doesn't cooperate.\n\n**We promptly leave at**\n
 **9:37 am.**\n\nHope to see you there!\n\nYou MUST respond with a YES to t
 he Hike Question in order to participate.\n\n**LEGAL DISCLAIMER AND LIABIL
 ITY INFORMATION:**\n\nBy RSVP'ing and paying the event fee (if applicable)
 \, you are confirming that you have read\, understand and accept the follo
 wing:\n\n1. **GTA Hiking Meetup is a private group.** Attending events is 
 voluntary by you as a member. Participation in any activity with us is at 
 your own risk.\n2. By joining this event as a member you agree to indemnif
 y and hold harmless its organizers\, co-organizers\, assistant organizers\
 , event hosts\, and other members from all claims or liability of every ty
 pe (including court costs and legal fees) for injury or death to any perso
 n or for damage to property\, loss of personal property or any other wrong
 ful act arising out of or relating to your participation as a member. This
  agreement applies to you and to other persons (as your guests) who may ac
 company you in these endeavors.\n3. Y**ou also agree to hold the organizer
 s as well as other group members harmless.** By participating voluntarily 
 in the group\, you expressly waive any and all such claims against each an
 d every other member in the group\, including without limitation any and a
 ll claims against the group organizer\, co-organizers\, assistant organize
 rs\, and event hosts.
